                                "sense_id": "3e320f31-1127-3338-a8fe-91cfd7ff9861",
                                "text": "In the linguistics of the Romance languages, the La Spezia–Rimini Line is a line that demarcates a number of important isoglosses that distinguish Romance languages south and east of the line from Romance languages north and west of it.",
